# Battle against Kyurem (the ice dragon of the Tao trio, the empty shell): a glockenspiel tolls the Tao figure every
# two bars, falling a fifth and climbing back, over hollow C-sharp-minor brass, celesta frost and a cold pad. Original
# composition for this game.
title Battle! Kyurem
tempo 164
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.4

track lead brass lowhp=sawlead vol=0.84 pan=0 rev=0.36
  r1 | o4 g+2 d+2 |
  L o4 g+2 o5 c+2 | o5 e2 o4 b4 a4 | o4 a2 o5 c+4 e4 | o5 d+2. c4 |
  o5 e2 g+4 f+4 | o5 g+2 b4 e4 | o5 f+2 d+4 c+4 | o5 d+2 c4 o4 g+4 |
  o5 c+2. e4 | o5 d+4. c+8 o4 b2 | o5 c+2 g+2 | o5 f+2 e4 c+4 |
  o5 e2 a2 | o5 g+2 f+4 e4 | o5 a4. g+8 f+4 c+4 | o5 g+2 d+4 c4 |

track counter celesta vol=0.48 pan=-0.25 rev=0.45
  r1 | r1 |
  L [ o5 c+8 g+8 e8 g+8 ]2 | [ o4 a8 o5 e8 c+8 e8 ]2 | [ o4 f+8 o5 c+8 o4 a8 o5 c+8 ]2 | [ o4 g+8 o5 d+8 c8 d+8 ]2 |
  [ o5 c+8 g+8 e8 g+8 ]2 | [ o5 e8 b8 g+8 b8 ]2 | [ o4 b8 o5 f+8 d+8 f+8 ]2 | [ o4 g+8 o5 d+8 c8 d+8 ]2 |
